| <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/94cc1ef5-2cc6-4954-a0ae-e63eb31ca19a\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a8c7891b-219d-40af-bb0f-70c67d7926a9\" />\nMobile | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/344d99f5-a595-4ef4-87ac-25c87830bd3c\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d0a1d553-aa4b-4d21-acce-b8c4aeddeb0e\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d4fa1075-4c74-4ac7-b33d-aea0276fdfd8\" />\nCompatibility | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/76a3070d-d341-4d23-9ade-67e0b1248ac7\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/80690775-c392-4845-ae8c-ffac5e514335\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/b484a691-73cf-4858-84dd-792cf9e3ec56\" />\n\n### With heightmapping\n\nRenderer | Microshadows OFF | Microshadows ON (0.85) | Microshadows OFF (AO Light Affect 1.0)\n-|-|-|-\nForward+ | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ae8bbb30-e18e-4ded-a014-1946cac67722\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/12cf4e40-321a-495a-ae40-263fdceed558\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f809b87d-fe98-4eb5-8a94-e9e0e091d0e5\" />\nMobile | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dc7e569b-89b1-4771-b1b6-b47113c9bbf0\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/eb727245-5720-4034-be74-90f54a8ca159\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f8e64a9d-0708-4583-86eb-1cf7c100bf71\" />\nCompatibility | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/03839eae-2901-4184-bcf7-cfc6ccbaf0e6\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/838e5bdf-57af-4326-b93d-3b5253fd4256\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/3b7bf8d8-7a45-4686-a508-83dec2a3cc3e\" />\n\n## Comparison (with bent normals)\n\n*Using https://github.com/LunaCapra/godot-bent-normals-test.\nCompatibility screenshots were taken with the reflection probe hidden, as it has broken ambient lighting.*\n\nRenderer | Microshadows OFF | Microshadows ON\n-|-|-\nForward+ | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/34e2779d-468c-4cef-b274-6fbfe4295fbd\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/fd461abe-1840-4e72-816b-c798b031449d\" />\nMobile | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ed4df432-a73b-47f6-b553-17aa65965ec6\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/dbd16ed9-e2cb-4dd4-beca-23bef2c2286a\" />\nCompatibility | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/11241e34-7057-4397-8f5e-56ce97e4cce2\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/ebce73ee-0315-46b2-9ccf-b56e963a9300\" />\n\nRenderer | Microshadows OFF | Microshadows ON\n-|-|-\nForward+ | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a2f01d94-37f7-43ec-adf5-704d1cddd105\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/77dc8791-004c-4074-9293-90e9855205df\" />\nMobile | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/6441d889-e501-4bda-baeb-600db0f7a942\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/93108860-b18b-44a3-8d44-73eeb0f96837\" />\nCompatibility | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5a14f5f4-2d2b-46a9-acfa-3607a3b26b67\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/2a17c31c-6b5a-4984-9c55-eaee5e0330ea\" />\n\nRenderer | Microshadows OFF | Microshadows ON\n-|-|-\nForward+ | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/d54b0a9b-5b2f-467b-818d-c7c3e6a612a3\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/217fcedc-ca30-44bd-98f2-58ccab08ddd1\" />\nMobile | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/5a143511-5705-47d0-bde8-ba1a8cca8a57\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/7810ae9c-6577-43cf-a87f-b4ac4dd206b6\" />\nCompatibility | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/834a960a-2b86-442e-b91b-0aa7b910b280\" /> | <img width=\"1152\" height=\"648\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/79d08546-69f4-4d46-a9ef-c9b19e2f8307\" />\n\nThe fringe material on the sofa's pillows (which is supposed to be transparent but it's opaque in the demo) seems to be having issues with microshadows:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/585aa16c-6beb-4233-9a3c-246915f61c84\n\nThe ORM map has the entire fringe area set to green (= ambient occlusion channel is `0.0`), so it's an issue on the source texture's end. This means that some assets may run into visual regression when microshadows are enabled (depending on how their AO/ORM maps were authored). Therefore, it's probably a good idea to leave this disabled for existing projects and enable it by default for new projects only.","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112449#pullrequestreview-5242453501","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112449","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112449#pullrequestreview-5242453501"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/112449"}},"submitted_at":"2026-09-18T00:21:23Z","commit_id":"7bb78d53b3b989bfe064cf643b44d962fa5bf7d1"},{"id":5242767842,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABOH5J4g","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/112449#pullrequestreview-5242767842","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine